Third-party data bundled in this repository is not covered by the above and
keeps its own terms. The Credits section of README.md names every source; in
short:

- ReferenceLibrary/*.dat and reference/a0v.dat — Pickles (1998) stellar
  spectral flux library, PASP 110, 863.
- ReferenceLibrary/notes/ — spectral-type cards compiled from the published
  classification references listed in ReferenceLibrary/notes/README.md.
- ReferenceLibrary/*_catalog.csv — nine published catalogues retrieved through
  VizieR, each credited in README.md. Cite them, and the CDS SIMBAD and VizieR
  services, in any publication using results from this program.

The instrument-response curves measured for this program (telluric.dat,
touptek-response.dat) are the author's own work and fall under the MIT grant
above.
